Evidence apex\" → \"the kind of cross-institutional evidence that makes local success conditions legible to" :flags []} {:id "writing-coherence/section-bridge-missing" :path "futon3/library/writing-coherence/section-bridge-missing.flexiarg" :hits 3 :title "Bridge the Section Boundary" :line 1 :sha256 "501dfa8c5b39219ae1db432e0690a7bd47fad1e9a742bc4e6b0ba8ed4ad3d6ea" :kind :practice :stage :act :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "THEN: “+ COMPOSITIONS: (1) Close on positioning: rewrite the closing sentence so it names what the section established AND points at what remains open. \"Frameworks for collective stewardship therefore direct attention away” — functional: implements or executes the work." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "+ COMPOSITIONS: (1) Close on positioning: rewrite the closing sentence so it names what the section established AND points at what remains open. \"Frameworks for collective stewardship therefore direct attention away" :flags []} {:id "writing-coherence/stale-reference-after-restructure" :path "futon3/library/writing-coherence/stale-reference-after-restructure.flexiarg" :hits 4 :title "Audit the Downstream After Restructure" :line 1 :sha256 "586073bc82fccb8ce1787fa9f69bd8adfddebc37f17ffada1ed39b99f86003f2" :kind :practice :stage :perceive :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "THEN: “Audit at the moment of restructure; update or delete every downstream reference; verify by grep. + COMPOSITIONS: (1) Audit at the moment of restructure: when removing or renaming an element, immediately grep the” — functional: observes or exposes state." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Audit at the moment of restructure; update or delete every downstream reference; verify by grep. + COMPOSITIONS: (1) Audit at the moment of restructure: when removing or renaming an element, immediately grep the" :flags []} {:id "writing-coherence/structural-style-inconsistency" :path "futon3/library/writing-coherence/structural-style-inc