e map — {capability-dimension × {channel × confidence}} — not a narrative description." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "capability/hinge-capability-extraction" :path "futon3/library/capability/hinge-capability-extraction.flexiarg" :hits 2 :line 1 :sha256 "3b3b82494671dae09b271b3f400fc0406b2228d34ebc45334c4290d6f1628e11" :kind :practice :stage :perceive :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern performs extraction of observations from hinge text, attributing evidence per voice, which is observing/exposing state." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "At a hinge, extract capability tags per attributed voice (agent-view vs operator-turn), not per block." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "cascade-construction/order-by-what-each-step-needs" :path "futon3/library/cascade-construction/order-by-what-each-step-needs.flexiarg" :hits 2 :line 1 :sha256 "33cb0eb2a2532ffa2ab64071430e6b7a7e1483b9f86a971eaaf7255dc4c2316b" :kind :practice :stage :select :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The THEN sets how a choice (step precedence/admission order) is determined from dependencies, a selection operation." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Derive order from guard and effect dependencies and record independence." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "contracts/every-entry-has-a-falsifier" :path "futon3/library/contracts/every-entry-has-a-falsifier.flexiarg" :hits 2 :line 1 :sha256 "ae7e7a5730bdcc9a358353052b7667e2d24c8eae85597c19f9175b72abf1bf89" :kind :practice :stage :assurance :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "Naming falsifiers and testing refuting behaviour makes each claim independently checkable, the assurance stage." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "Each correspondence names concrete refuting behaviours, and a test exercises at least one that a plausible wrong implementation would fail." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "futon-theory/crime-relocates-to-a-scarcer-witness" :path "futon3/library/futon-theory/crime-relocates-to-a-scarcer-witness.flexiarg" :hits 2 :line 1 :sha256 "faa366f4cebf604a080f478823542a63136fe543c314a9269cee708f06928fce" :kind :subject :stage :assurance :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern is about how claims are witnessed and hardened against faking, i.e. the assurance stage, as design theory." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "So the defense is not one detector but a LADDER of progressively scarcer witnesses, terminating where the witness is too costly to forge" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "hygiene/classify-by-remedy-judgement" :path "futon3/library/hygiene/classify-by-remedy-judgement.flexiarg" :hits 2 :line 1 :sha256 "e92170b09972927aa386039c87105fd3f0c3055173c4a85428f842aaec45bab8" :kind :practice :stage :select :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "Classification assigns each item to a class with its own remedy, setting the admission/routing condition for what happens to it — selection." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "Split items into classes by the judgement their remedy needs, each with its own remedy, declared uncertainty and an explicit unclassifiable class." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "hygiene/settle-with-meters" :path "futon3/library/hygiene/settle-with-meters.flexiarg" :hits 2 :line 1 :sha256 "fdba89b0c3681438e3a174f260ff4f5020eb3f2059b08ec03a658b71ee8ed518" :kind :practice :stage :perceive :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern performs emission of meters that expose what happened and what is unknown, i.e. observing/exposing state." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "Each cycle ends with typed meters, declared thresholds, unavailable truth as a legal value, changes rather than steady states, and measured rather than assumed benefit." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "iching/hexagram-1