ection." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Provide clear constraints and allow iterative learning." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "iching/hexagram-12-pi" :path "futon3/library/iching/hexagram-12-pi.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "5810aba7d0ac759369e797e3430aadabe17a015e58b492000650ba251d6a037f" :kind :practice :stage :act :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The operative instruction is to execute a repair of the broken channel, i.e. perform the work of restoring exchange." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Restore circulation by re-linking the poles. Reduce domination, invite reciprocity, and reopen the path." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "iching/hexagram-21-shihe" :path "futon3/library/iching/hexagram-21-shihe.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "87d851fdac5c81ecb1cfb3c5b0a903fa0100c9068278f677c5283a4d97b6b47f" :kind :practice :stage :act :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern's core directive is explicit decisive execution to clear a blockage." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Act decisively and precisely to remove the obstruction." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "iching/hexagram-29-kan" :path "futon3/library/iching/hexagram-29-kan.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "178a813df800f2dd48afd77472c9870d4ada61f0271f1a56d8856ba2c44fc117" :kind :practice :stage :act :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "It instructs how to carry out movement under hazard, an execution-mode directive." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Proceed with steady, cautious movement; avoid sharp swings." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "iching/hexagram-34-dazhuang" :path "futon3/library/iching/hexagram-34-dazhuang.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "7ae3c0c40515e9ef747d148f3bf88ba3faea48b8401a42910fa0c096bcf3d1a4" :kind :practice :stage :act :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The directive governs the manner of a