ation, just identification fields and deferred lift mappings." :quote-field "BECAUSE" :quote "Explicit encodings make exotype knowledge inspectable and comparable." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "iiching/exotype-179" :path "futon3/library/iiching/exotype-179.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "427f1bf3c6d08bd4288a74aba67090e535b27694962688e09108a5a3a10207be" :kind :subject :stage :none :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "A bare canonical encoding record pointing at futon5 manifests; it states no perceive/believe/act operation." :quote-field "BECAUSE" :quote "Explicit encodings make exotype knowledge inspectable and comparable." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "test-registry/bind-the-subject" :path "futon3/library/test-registry/bind-the-subject.flexiarg" :hits 13 :line 1 :sha256 "733d8f17ea52a475dbb715ecdd0f67b17112df56c26d9b285e72e00b2348fa53" :kind :practice :stage :believe :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern's core operation is an append-only index and incident log that record what is known about subject warrants, so it performs the believe stage." :quote-field "BECAUSE" :quote "The binding records acceptance and the incident records observation; only a new run, registered and accepted, carries information that postdates both." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "translation/test-by-reproducing-behaviour" :path "futon3/library/translation/test-by-reproducing-behaviour.flexiarg" :hits 9 :line 1 :sha256 "60442e7757a1aaaddc920969e5e4d965fe199ad47c7f149a70710e97f74282c4" :kind :practice :stage :assurance :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern is a testing discipline with falsifiers and attributed disagreements, making the translation claim independently checkable — assurance." :quote-field "BECAUSE" :quote "A test the wrong translation would also pass shows nothing." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-0