he-unit-of-use.flexiarg" :hits 3 :line 1 :sha256 "c259144e5fe5e126f905b05040618315b8c73f03bd03803b05407517a8c8f3eb" :kind :subject :stage :perceive :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "A design decision (subject) about exposing cascade state to seats as a provenance-labeled slice, i.e. about how state is observed and exposed." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Make the queryable object always a slice with labeled edge classes" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "coordination/session-durability-check" :path "futon3/library/coordination/session-durability-check.flexiarg" :hits 3 :line 1 :sha256 "94ec03f3fe051f99e9d4dac39df9f3ac08140903ef17cf56372466000b294e88" :kind :practice :stage :assurance :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The G0 check rejects success unless the proof-path durably persists, preserving the trace of claims — assurance." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "If you want coordinated work to compound, gate successful responses on durable persistence of the full proof-path and its evidence records." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "test-registry/warrant-only-the-wires" :path "futon3/library/test-registry/warrant-only-the-wires.flexiarg" :hits 3 :line 1 :sha256 "f73b02e540f94761c36af5ec23db5636c6f3da705b144adc0e82fefe96fa41aa" :kind :practice :stage :select :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern sets an admission condition — a proposed subject must name a wire before it is bound — which is the select stage." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Admit subjects only from the wire register; keep the register a live join of theory edges, requirements and bindings" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "agent/hypothetical-proof-architecture" :path "futon3/library/agent/hypothetical-proof-architecture.flexiarg" :hits 2 :line 1 :sha256 "0355fa1ee29cd6f2b06570d47c03d1e3529196ba1019c57c6bdff29d4319094b" :kind :subject :stage :select :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "A math formalisation technique (subject) about triaging and prioritizing among proof paths, i.e. setting a choice of where effort goes." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Prioritize paths with fewer open nodes, parallel structure, and no known-hard sub-problems." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "buffer-cleaner/observe-categories" :path "futon3/library/buffer-cleaner/observe-categories.flexiarg" :hits 2 :line 1 :sha256 "71be13a0042323c7655ab25af3c14d0076ab45fe7b125d9e0bcd3dc6cf2f4fd2" :kind :practice :stage :perceive :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The collector observes and exposes buffer state read-only with no decisions, which is exactly the perceive stage." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "Observation tags each buffer with its structural category and raw signals; every decision is left to the wiring that consumes the packet." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "math-formalization/separate-proof-transfer-from-artifact-replay" :path "futon3/library/math-formalization/separate-proof-transfer-from-artifact-replay.flexiarg" :hits 2 :line 1 :sha256 "99d5a9b3c4641966f3faeb8d336547717e4cd7768634c67f1975a877db9cc1ae" :kind :practice :stage :evaluate :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern performs evaluation: it scores and classifies two outcomes of a formalization episode separately, weighing what each kind of reuse actually measured." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Credit artifact transfer and independent verification as successful. Mark strategy-learning or independent-solve conclusions as unmeasured." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "pattern-mining/probe-the-claimed-property-not-the-acceptance-proxy" :path "futon3/library/pattern-mining/probe-the-claimed-property-not-the-acceptance-proxy.flexiarg" :hits 2 :line 1 :sha256 "eaa5f4b9e104fea25100f23a959b84682df8ee8e5b153b2c17436f97d3c35c99" :kind :practice :stage :assurance :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern makes acceptance claims independently checkable by replacing proxies with direct probes tested against fixtures over the whole trust closure." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "run the strongest available direct probe on every member of that closure; test the probe against known-good, known-bad, and multi-defect fixtures" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "plos-npt-with-small-n/quote-table-not-quote-flood" :path "futon3/library/plos-npt-with-small-n/quote-table-not-quote-flood.flexiarg" :hits 2 :line 1 :sha256 "4783363427f69123a98d3220ffe010e52384c96856478c8d70dfa3cabecff0ea" :kind :subject :stage :perceive :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The technique is about how evidence is displayed so claims and quotes become easy to inspect, i.e. exposing state to a reader." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Separate interpretation from parallel evidence display." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "vsat-next/narrative-arc-infographics" :path "futon3/library/vsatlas/vsat-vsatlas.multiarg" :hits 2 :line 1 :sha256 "7ca36d03501af9e3809a3c8aab55d9631d7e952330d1c8e04ed79baa32abd0d5" :kind :subject :stage :perceive :stage-mode :functional-and-topical :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern generates visual summaries whose purpose is to expose story structure for quick reading — a perceive operation." :quote-field "BECAUSE" :quote "Visual summaries surface strengths and gaps without flattening the work." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "vsatelier/projection-independence" :path "futon3/library/vsatelier/projection-independence.flexiarg" :hits 2 :line 1 :sha256 "5acde3a4a694186af3d9339836afe22cfe58547a57cae71c54254b815fe574c1" :kind :subject :stage :believe :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The design decision concerns how deliberation knowledge is represented — as renderer-independent data structures and contracts." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Define the deliberation layer (flags, decisions, commitments, return loops) as data structures and interaction contracts, not as rendering code." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "vsatlas/askew-layer" :path "futon3/library/vsatlas/askew-layer.flexiarg" :hits 2 :line 1 :sha256 "2eb3257d33fc37cb761ed92207d3ad4b9d0fc0e113249ac79b1d5fb45a2514ec" :kind :subject :stage :believe :stage-mode :functional-and-topical :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The pattern adds a layer that records proposed interpretations and relations separately from canonical content, i.e. representing what is known without revising the original record." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Add an interpretive “askew” layer where contributors propose arcs, passages, and conceptual bridges without modifying originals." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "ai4ci/pilot-feasibility" :path "futon3/library/ai4ci/pilot-feasibility.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "9b43de25e3aba922334ad8d53d53825a648df6f5cd017e80d082f598bf0731fe" :kind :practice :stage :select :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern sets an admission condition on work: it fixes what is in and out of scope so diverging work is visible as scope creep." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Freeze scope to: proof selection, dual-layer annotation (AI proposals plus human review), seminar-based evaluation, and reporting" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "buffer-cleaner/exempt-the-in-use" :path "futon3/library/buffer-cleaner/exempt-the-in-use.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "db578df8fd37b0eaf3136ca6e03f621659364b1e90e824f1f8bc332b57cb3420" :kind :practice :stage :select :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern defines an admission condition enforced before any scoring, selecting which items a policy may act on at all." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Define the exempt class by structural or witnessed facts, non-parameterized; enforce it before eligibility so every wiring inherits it" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "cascade-construction/separate-construction-from-meaning-review" :path "futon3/library/cascade-construction/separate-construction-from-meaning-review.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "9511f56cd30d03733d36f0fd34c1c738b900dd8f49033b48e12c932ec5aa46d1" :kind :practice :stage :coordination :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern routes semantic claims to the party who owns the model's meaning and routes corrections back, a work-routing operation between agents." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Name the claims, send them to the meaning owner, apply and record corrections." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "corps/letting-the-trace-teach" :path "futon3/library/corps/letting-the-trace-teach.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "fd9108e8d535a2de90dedae619c95200e49baf15d5d0ab4c71d09feb3a3931b5" :kind :practice :stage :coordination :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The pattern moves private learning into shared venues so peers can respond, routing communication between the researcher and collaborators." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Encourage the release of small, well-scoped artefacts—annotated examples, brief reflections, walkthroughs, explanatory notes—into venues where relevant peers already circulate." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "math-formalization-CA/measure-restrict-simplify" :path "futon3/library/math-formalization-CA/measure-restrict-simplify.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "11fc58b6c104a603e84b3b7299be94a45454ebbb4f27632d06fd8b90dfbb1729" :kind :subject :stage :act :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "A Lean proof technique that executes a rewrite chain to simplify a measure goal; math formalisation is subject content whose prescribed operation is executing the proof step." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Chain: Measure.restrict_apply → Real.volume_Icc → ofReal_one → one_rpow → mul_one." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "math-formalization-FA/lf-map-continuity-via-fixed-support-stages" :path "futon3/library/math-formalization-FA/lf-map-continuity-via-fixed-support-stages.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "63d181f3d525672367073c5be8459182418a14c37d2fa6b572b5ef319d875ef4" :kind :subject :stage :act :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "Prescribes constructing stage maps and proving continuity — the doing of the proof work; an advanced formalisation technique, hence subject/topical." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Prove its continuity with `WithSeminorms.continuous_of_isBounded`, supplying for each target seminorm a finite set of source seminorms and a nonnegative constant." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "math-formalization/additive-principal-parts-from-order-germs" :path "futon3/library/math-formalization/additive-principal-parts-from-order-germs.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "6258eb90973bb83465d58daad0d08af295e9c944e7b690a5d05750ee114851a3" :kind :subject :stage :act :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "A complex-analysis construction technique that carries out the decomposition locally; the pattern is about performing the construction, not about a workflow stage." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "build each principal part locally from the order germ and prove the remainder has nonnegative order; no global additive decomposition theorem is needed." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "math-formalization/memlp-power-law-scalar-thresholds" :path "futon3/library/math-formalization/memlp-power-law-scalar-thresholds.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "b7efe0e998afbbc6fab4538e9f023dc6f80479af3eca05d06cb08c6897f3212d" :kind :subject :stage :act :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "Prescribes a concrete reduction pipeline (rewrite, normalize, discharge) to execute the proof; a formalisation technique, so subject with act as the performed operation." :quote-field "BECAUSE" :quote "The mathematical content is entirely in the scalar threshold; everything between the `MemLp` goal and the scalar library is coercion" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "math-informal/work-examples-first" :path "futon3/library/math-informal/work-examples-first.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "94a4e9d3eca91b258732ded72acadda318cbd95016be7252282a24cefc28ec8c" :kind :practice :stage :perceive :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "A way of working that gathers concrete observations to build intuition before proving — it performs the perceive stage by exposing what instances show." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Compute several concrete instances. Choose examples that are generic (not too symmetric), that test boundary conditions, and that span different regimes of the parameters." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "math-strategy/hypothesis-category-check" :path "futon3/library/math-strategy/hypothesis-category-check.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "5bce1e1fac2fecae5afbd3886e78dc2e9a84b11103aeef33657d73ac536f46db" :kind :practice :stage :assurance :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "A verification check that a theorem's categorical hypotheses actually hold, guarding against silent errors — it makes an application independently checkable, which is assurance." :quote-field "BECAUSE" :quote "The fix is mechanical: check the fine print. The cost of checking is minutes; the cost of not checking is a critical reviewer finding." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "mmca/threshold-shaped-events" :path "futon3/library/mmca/threshold-shaped-events.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "17b4c47951657887bfc87a79cabac014e7c45fa3288c5ec22a506d34ba8db6cf" :kind :practice :stage :evaluate :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern weighs whether a measured count reflects phenomena or detector artifacts by comparing durations against the threshold — an evaluation of what the measurement means." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Compute the duration distribution of episodes, and compare its median and its lower quantiles against the threshold W." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "or/overlay-bridges" :path "futon3/library/or/or.multiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "8db817b2985bd79ae0b9324d10afa6cf7e4560fd2faa9f297d10195ea1bec9f6" :kind :subject :stage :coordination :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "A publishing design decision about routing manuscripts and review bundles between community review and journals — the text is about coordinating work between parties." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Build overlay bridges that route manuscripts through open, community-based review while retaining compatibility with target journals." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "or3/sustainability-without-enclosure" :path "futon3/library/or3/sustainability-without-enclosure.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "2ba2411004f7fbe9cd0641789ca72d13125cf563ba51ef31b86f4731059f1a16" :kind :subject :stage :evaluate :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The design decision weighs revenue-model options against the constraint of keeping the licence open — evaluating consequences and trade-offs of sustainability choices." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Treat the licence as fixed and search the rest of the space. Test revenue models that sell scarce things rather than the code:" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "p4ng/five-p-rhythm" :path "futon3/library/p4ng/p4ng-orpatterns.multiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "bfe4b722a31ac29281f4e2924c6970cc2e132f06df1c7ab72944f75383cadfb4" :kind :practice :stage :select :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "Prescribes a fixed staged structure that paces and prioritises impact work — setting the order and priority of work, which is the select stage." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Use a five-stage rhythm (problem, people, process, product, proof) to organise work." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "p4ng/harvest-before-close" :path "futon3/library/p4ng/p4ng-workshops.multiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "e17c808364c5b386fb707b1fa0347161236a387789df41edc55019c6c274d57c" :kind :practice :stage :believe :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The THEN prescribes capturing reusable knowledge mid-session, i.e. recording what is known before it is lost, which is the believe stage." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Insert a mid-session capture: “What’s something reusable?”" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "p4ng/meta-reflection-loop-agent" :path "futon3/library/p4ng/p4ng-agents.multiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "cbf2cae9d526aa5f99a424f359c536c015f341aec9aab020288ece7996ac084a" :kind :practice :stage :evaluate :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The THEN is a self-assessment that reviews methods and assesses their fit, which is weighing options and limits — the evaluate stage." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Trigger a self-assessment subroutine to review recent methods, assess their fit, and recommend updates to its operating protocol." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "p4ng/pattern-activation" :path "futon3/library/p4ng/p4ng-agents.multiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "cbf2cae9d526aa5f99a424f359c536c015f341aec9aab020288ece7996ac084a" :kind :practice :stage :select :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The THEN filters a catalogue down to a focused candidate set, an admission/choice operation matching the select stage." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Retrieve a focused set of candidate patterns using contextual filters (task type, known tensions, goals) to prime downstream reasoning." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "p4ng/reflect-in-layers" :path "futon3/library/p4ng/p4ng-agent-environments.multiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "ec83db2855f0ef0935723ff21bfab6325d1476b3345577f11241ca3671397873" :kind :practice :stage :believe :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "Layered reflection revises and deepens what the group understands, which is the believe stage of recording/revising what is known." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Apply multi-layer reflection (context, values, assumptions)." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "p4ng/role-reveal-agent" :path "futon3/library/p4ng/p4ng-agents.multiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "cbf2cae9d526aa5f99a424f359c536c015f341aec9aab020288ece7996ac084a" :kind :practice :stage :coordination :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "Broadcasting who does what routes roles and communication between collaborating parties, the coordination stage." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Explicitly broadcast role identifiers, including function, capabilities, and limits, and align behaviour to those declarations." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "pacspine/obligations-checker" :path "futon3/library/pacspine/pacspine.multiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "9843465c6ba2c780b43a64065bc1e96fb5a84c9facc74e640bf76c428871e7c1" :kind :practice :stage :select :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "Committing to obligations sets standing admission conditions that each letter must satisfy, which is the select stage." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Commit to obligations (preserve voice, no invention, honour paramitā hinge) that keep the art-book frame intact." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "pattern-coherence/internal-coherence" :path "futon3/library/pattern-coherence/internal-coherence.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "d44712027dd826a653ddf365c43969e8716e7a0ad67e2e4cadc88cd51bacf4b1" :kind :practice :stage :evaluate :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The THEN is a checking move that weighs whether action, problem, and outcome genuinely fit, the evaluate stage." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Check that each element maps: problem → constraint, action → constraint relief, outcome → constraint lifted." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "peeragogy/polling-for-ideas" :path "futon3/library/peeragogy/polling-for-ideas.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "56fde1196e9eb1fe47d8ff5ddd5f9540bc2ebf58728b59495d42d8bb166a3ee3" :kind :practice :stage :coordination :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "Polling gathers the group's input before commitment, routing the decision through the parties involved — the coordination stage." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "it usually pays to *poll for ideas* first rather than have one person commit on behalf of the group" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "plos-npt-with-small-n/barrier-enabler-strategy-display" :path "futon3/library/plos-npt-with-small-n/barrier-enabler-strategy-display.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "f068927b5ac43f4693c52ce89bf6301647ddee1d20a852d6b70a42bcb236b3f3" :kind :practice :stage :act :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The conclusion prescribes producing a concrete display artefact in the paper, executing the writing work — the act stage." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "Implementation and open-science qualitative papers should convert themes into an action-facing display near the end" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "problems/commitment-temperature-is-instrumented-as-gain" :path "futon3/library/problems/commitment-temperature-is-instrumented-as-gain.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "6d190ab07b8361543dd2a3db93281865eaeb5fabceb2ab5271b0032c2957430c" :kind :subject :stage :perceive :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "Birth-time instrumentation records and measures the gain at the flip, an observation/exposure of state at node R14, the perceive stage." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Record commitment temperature at the flip, link it to the resulting actuator transition, and measure how it changes the next selected action." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "cycle-machine/disruption-soak" :path "futon3/library/cycle-machine/disruption-soak.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "8e678fbe45c90d963229e29b95fcdb6d9e7d42cc24ae269d0eb9d3e4c3faf0c1" :kind :practice :stage :assurance :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern's whole purpose is to make the durability claim independently checkable by injecting disruptions and asserting resumption, which is the assurance stage." :quote-field "BECAUSE" :quote "a test that makes it for every disruption is the only artefact that converts the week's incident log into a finite list" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "eight-gates/lie-split" :path "futon3/library/eight-gates/lie-split.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "c3c1deb1b687b27f6c66f0b3b362d6730d4e66a4b0a33f580a276eda86c70457" :kind :practice :stage :act :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The pattern is about performing the act of splitting a monolithic situation along its natural joints, so its content is the act stage." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Apply two forces in opposite directions—not to destroy but to reveal structure" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "eight-gates/press-mechanism" :path "futon3/library/eight-gates/press-mechanism.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "4aee5b02c82b614a4bade3ec11d06896797455fa530b234d55dfe2ed518498c7" :kind :practice :stage :evaluate :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern performs a test that weighs whether a BECAUSE clause is a genuine mechanism or decorative rationalization, an evaluation of warrants." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Concentrate force on a specific point: the BECAUSE clause. Apply the mechanism test" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "enrichment/indentation-as-complexity" :path "futon3/library/enrichment/indentation-as-complexity.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "cc4d94ba6f9d092a8d62ba863e72cfee2f64a9ff3a498ed80f2345377d310123" :kind :subject :stage :perceive :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The design decision ingests a cheap metric to observe and expose complexity state of files, which is the perceive stage." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Ingest mean-depth, max-depth, and line-count per file as code/indentation-complexity hyperedges" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "eoi-engine/tension-foreclosure" :path "futon3/library/eoi-engine/tension-foreclosure.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "f69586b93216f3a3bc6203398929e71dd3a0e96c5f83d893019092ca8120d095" :kind :practice :stage :believe :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The pattern concerns recording explicitly what is being given up so knowledge of foreclosures is represented rather than implicit, the believe stage." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Author writes a short foreclosure-honesty paragraph naming the substantive losses an acceptance would entail" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "exotic/graded-naturality" :path "futon3/library/exotic/graded-naturality.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "215c2732b0a856ce13587fc6f5cb96f9127c19c05676fdb624a1243cc13409d1" :kind :subject :stage :evaluate :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The design decision sets up graded metrics and residuals that weigh how close transformations are to commutative rather than pass/fail, an evaluation operation." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Use graded metrics: mission-path edit distance as primary, evidence-vector distance as soft penalty/bonus" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "futon-theory/baldwin-cycle" :path "futon3/library/futon-theory/baldwin-cycle.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "67dafb559a79bb26c8d328e21625c834c2b527a5dd94d46efb8e98d72a33823c" :kind :practice :stage :act :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The pattern is about executing a learning cycle of exploration, assimilation, and canalization operations, so it is about the act of doing that work." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "explore (learn within constraints), assimilate (fix successful adaptations into genotype), canalize (remove unnecessary freedom, make success cheap)" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "hdm/human-machine-dialogue" :path "futon3/library/hdm/human-machine-dialogue.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "a044a0c482da387db7221cf95950896f4d4f5a02e103556fadb2136e5b7df5d9" :kind :subject :stage :coordination :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The design embeds dialogue routing questions and answers between humans and the system, which is coordination between parties." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "let the system ask humans for help, record exchanges as scholia, and treat resolved clarifications as reusable knowledge" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "hygiene/receipt-then-gate" :path "futon3/library/hygiene/receipt-then-gate.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "9cb4d48129a64639071e0c18c8eed1d54eb0860f19ae1537810ac35de2df3609" :kind :practice :stage :assurance :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern makes each act independently re-verified at execution time and preserves the basis as a receipt, which is the assurance stage." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "A proposal is recorded with its full basis; an act passes a gate that re-verifies at execution time, and refuses typedly" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "iching/hexagram-03-zhun" :path "futon3/library/iching/hexagram-03-zhun.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "8fa3a8436176c68d325b46d2ff95012608539e96176ec4595fc3bbbf05fac02e" :kind :subject :stage :act :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The hexagram's content prescribes implementing minimal scaffolds and small-step advances at a chaotic beginning, the act stage." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Establish minimal scaffolds and advance in small steps" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "problems/devmap-self-consistency-standards" :path "futon3/library/problems/devmap-self-consistency-standards.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "8b12a8d1e13b2d825bd69786db01418efff03f440e22a8431f89bf531a94d4a1" :kind :subject :stage :assurance :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The problem the node states is about machine-checkable standards for devmap quality, which is about making claims checkable (assurance) rather than performing a stage." :quote-field "HOWEVER" :quote "machine-checkable standards for devmap quality" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "problems/r11-hierarchical-shared-budget" :path "futon3/library/problems/r11-hierarchical-shared-budget.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "8766a8eae723bbea75dcd04b59885f2048ae3f98b2f9ec89ae037b708d01315d" :kind :subject :stage :select :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The text places R11 in SELECT and describes arbitrating a shared budget, i.e. admission/selection of proposals under a finite resource." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "R11 solves how locally factored proposals share a finite resource without silently oversubscribing it" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "problems/r3a-prediction-error-projection" :path "futon3/library/problems/r3a-prediction-error-projection.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "16d1b840a27bbf59d86c8ea411c627bb69c687b8b0643cccf8b2b965d19bda0f" :kind :subject :stage :believe :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The roster places R3a in BELIEVE and the node is about joining observations to belief-derived predictions, a belief-stage mediator." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "R3a solves the join between an observation and the belief-derived prediction it can contradict" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "realtime/learn-as-you-go" :path "futon3/library/realtime/learn-as-you-go.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "5037bf0c380ed01d341af465a5c0cd1a1e584b627e635b945f54054c4088d07d" :kind :practice :stage :believe :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The practice is recording what works and fails as patterns, which is recording and revising what is known (believe)." :quote-field "BECAUSE" :quote "Explicit learnings reduce repeated mistakes and speed calibration." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "sidecar/per-id-audit-timeline-linkage" :path "futon3/library/sidecar/per-id-audit-timeline-linkage.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "c770af3ca149b74195167aff6e4f890fda7f7d010817531e82abaf7b333e80f6" :kind :practice :stage :perceive :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The mechanism surfaces all related events in a single per-id view, i.e. it exposes state for inspection (perceive)." :quote-field "BECAUSE" :quote "Cross-entity linkage turns append-only logs into inspectable histories." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "snatch/an-unmodelled-response-stops-the-line" :path "futon3/library/snatch/an-unmodelled-response-stops-the-line.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "6f18c4f1518740522dca6ecc5abf4e032e32169ec073c0ee06b887e46f871244" :kind :practice :stage :believe :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The prescribed move is to revise the model by adding a disposition and re-deriving predictions, i.e. revising what is known (believe)." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Stop. Name the disposition that would explain the response, add it, and re-derive the prediction before the next round." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "snatch/exchange-when-both-sides-gain" :path "futon3/library/snatch/exchange-when-both-sides-gain.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "c38d844ac6798fd9a328a86624863316e40bde043d52d337975a8484f8417345" :kind :practice :stage :act :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The pattern tells the player to actually propose an exchange in the round, executing the work of play (act)." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Propose a non-zero exchange whose give and ask leave both players better off if accepted." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "snatch/mark-without-force" :path "futon3/library/snatch/mark-without-force.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "c3da5ea0ee41251419ae82d3aa6e4bfaf6346b69a871e95305ef5ad348f1751e" :kind :practice :stage :believe :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The mechanism is a durable visible record that accumulates, i.e. it records state (believe) rather than altering current payoffs." :quote-field "BECAUSE" :quote "A record that persists changes future play even when it changes nothing present." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "snatch/price-the-final-round-as-final" :path "futon3/library/snatch/price-the-final-round-as-final.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "553e9fe7d2484ec0161d6a67fbf4aa4ab21438d83ca9d0c4346f465eb02bedef" :kind :practice :stage :evaluate :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern is about weighing this round's payoffs against zero continuation value, which is evaluating consequences (evaluate)." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Recompute the move from this round's exchange payoff and any remedy that acts now" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "snatch/use-talk-to-make-a-testable-offer" :path "futon3/library/snatch/use-talk-to-make-a-testable-offer.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "ad391bbe1806f54f27f693e83124b3454da16c2e0f45a59bcc159ef29ab5d04e" :kind :practice :stage :assurance :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The practice retains the message alongside the action so the claim can later be checked against what happened, making talk independently checkable (assurance)." :quote-field "BECAUSE" :quote "Non-binding talk creates information when it makes a prediction specific enough to be contradicted." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "software-design/agent-command-pattern" :path "futon3/library/software-design/agent-command-pattern.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "dc7098aaf3425b387f9a0c6592797e7b23fbc0579808b7108198a9b0800bec0a" :kind :subject :stage :act :stage-mode :functional-and-topical :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern is a design decision about how work is executed: operations become Command values run through an execution pipeline, so it concerns the act stage." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Encapsulate every such operation as a Command value that carries `:id`, parameters, provenance, capability tags, and optional `undo!`" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "storage/startup-integrity-gate" :path "futon3/library/storage/startup-integrity-gate.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "3960fe34f321edcb164496bc7f6e1b9225d1dfc45882bb76994c14e3814b595d" :kind :practice :stage :select :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The gate sets an admission condition — startup is blocked until checks pass — which is a select-stage operation (with an assurance flavour via diagnostics)." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "block startup until rehydration and invariant checks pass, and emit precise diagnostics on failure" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "system-coherence/argue-empirically-not-persuasively" :path "futon3/library/system-coherence/argue-empirically-not-persuasively.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "650c8de2aa9551be84c5102e9d599edbc96672d649745bfcebd8bb1c28e8f43a" :kind :practice :stage :evaluate :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern is a discipline for weighing whether claims are derivable from what the action has produced, i.e. evaluating claims against evidence." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "a claim belongs at the bootstrap if it follows from the bootstrap's own action under reasonable assumptions" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "t4r/exec-summary" :path "futon3/library/t4r/exec-summary.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "7e8a7087a42d61c1ad1199259ed4b036dc27b4e3bea1e3fec1a0b33646e611e6" :kind :subject :stage :coordination :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The content is about coordinating doctoral projects and collective practice across domains, so the subject matter is coordination between parties." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "talk4real reimagines doctoral training as a shared experimental learning infrastructure that continually refines itself" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "translation/declare-what-is-lost" :path "futon3/library/translation/declare-what-is-lost.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "4d076f3ea837c347c28364d531257c04e62bbad00c9c9a8776541bd2130bb7e6" :kind :practice :stage :assurance :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "Declaring losses makes a translation's reliability independently checkable by its readers, which is the assurance stage." :quote-field "BECAUSE" :quote "A reader can only rely on a translation whose limits they can see." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "vsat/reflective-container" :path "futon3/library/vsatlas/vsat-vsatlas.multiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "7ca36d03501af9e3809a3c8aab55d9631d7e952330d1c8e04ed79baa32abd0d5" :kind :subject :stage :believe :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The pattern is about scaffolding meaning-making — participants articulating and revising interpretations — which concerns the believe stage." :quote-field "IF" :quote "Workshops want participants to articulate significance, not just events." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "vsatelier/cluster-as-agenda" :path "futon3/library/vsatelier/cluster-as-agenda.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "111d8ee53f6d0d645aebe56b2862c78d74d1b2bedd1a476b07c13c3417800ade" :kind :practice :stage :coordination :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The flag gesture routes a spatial observation into a deliberation queue for stewards, which is routing work between parties — coordination." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "The flag becomes an agenda item in a facilitation queue visible to stewards." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "vsatlas/audience-shift" :path "futon3/library/vsatlas/audience-shift.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "b9cbeda4ba2d66bbb96f7d4c35c1b13aee1cd600d2620959ff5f570b74a03c0f" :kind :subject :stage :coordination :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The design decision concerns communication loops between participants — peer-to-peer exchange — so its subject is coordination." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "Design for peer-to-peer audiences by enabling reciprocal storytelling loops and navigable inter-story connections." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "vsatlas/isolarion-drift" :path "futon3/library/vsatlas/isolarion-drift.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "294a625d4e1ca9e5063e03e281a39f18d439fb93b7f5732b6a17b5e511568d4d" :kind :subject :stage :believe :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The manifold layer is a representational structure for shared meaning across narratives, concerning how knowledge is represented and related — believe." :quote-field "BECAUSE" :quote "Relational topology converts isolated narratives into a shared world with emergent coherence." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "vsatlas/offer-ladder" :path "futon3/library/vsatlas/offer-ladder.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "54a3fba54766a7449453342d180e63687569e2be4c8a42b1276b04591a2a238b" :kind :subject :stage :select :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The ladder structures the choices institutions make among purchasable rungs, so its subject is the setting of options and priorities — select." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "Define a simple offer ladder (intro workshop → multi-session pilot → annual programme) where each rung has a clear scope, price band, and expected outcome." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "vsatlas/peeragogical-infrastructures" :path "futon3/library/vsatlas/peeragogical-infrastructures.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "76e27a123d2d695b3e6f28d87b50d1cf98ec823503dff5c20eeec751fc18528a" :kind :subject :stage :coordination :stage-mode :topical :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The design decision embeds scaffolds whose purpose is coordination between contributors (co-authorship, joint decision-making), so it is a subject matter decision about coordination." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Embed scaffolds for co-authorship, negotiation of meaning, stewardship, and joint decision-making inside the manifold." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "war-room/wr-11-external-applications-carry-predecessor-exemplar-relationships" :path "futon3/library/war-room/wr-11-external-applications-carry-predecessor-exemplar-relationships.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "e34e45b3d6f83e1a3b8c81d35345b8646d198b8929a1625aec7a8ce0b159b3cc" :kind :practice :stage :believe :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The operator-facing practice revises the record: it reclassifies the application and writes the predecessor-exemplar relationship into the spine, recording what is now known." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Graduate the application from substrate deliverable to operational blueprint, give the graduation bulletin-grade visibility, and write the predecessor-exemplar relationship to the spine." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "war-room/wr-22-logic-model-before-code-is-a-sanctioned-verify-method" :path "futon3/library/war-room/wr-22-logic-model-before-code-is-a-sanctioned-verify-method.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "e0aa8e7761147014400f9ce0a3f503f8fd82202d338225ffffeaac199b3b4565" :kind :practice :stage :assurance :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern is a VERIFY method that checks invariants against adversarial traces, making the design's claims independently checkable before code exists." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "Execute the design as a logic model over abstract adversarial traces, and carve out every empirical or substrate-dependent guarantee into a separate spike." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "writing-coherence/cross-section-claim-drift" :path "futon3/library/writing-coherence/cross-section-claim-drift.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "008c31dc3007e2ce4f5ee96d961b879ce8c642e874ddc18f23849c0423af7de3" :kind :practice :stage :assurance :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "Canonical verbatim wording with marked variation preserves the trace of each claim's invocations, letting a reader check repeat invocation as repeat invocation." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "A load-bearing factual claim should have one canonical wording, used verbatim wherever the claim is invoked, with deliberate variation only when the variation is itself doing argumentative work." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "writing-coherence/paraphrase-drift" :path "futon3/library/writing-coherence/paraphrase-drift.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "3b9846f93a12205787ac28d28cb603ef99de6a1ca445de87fa67977e422502af" :kind :practice :stage :act :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The pattern directs the writer to execute the writing work itself: develop, cut, or replace restating sentences so the paragraph advances." :quote-field "CONCLUSION" :quote "Each sentence in a paragraph must add something the preceding sentences did not." :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "象/制度有时" :path "futon3/library/象/制度有时.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "0648275aa9010ad177d3f136428d7c420a451d0ac4eb45d6f65d61b5406e2cb7" :kind :practice :stage :believe :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :medium :rationale "The pattern's justification rests on a dated incident record of when rules were installed and why, and the rule itself requires institutions to record version and effective interval — it maintains what is recorded, so believe." :quote-field "BECAUSE" :quote "2026-09-24 15:48 Joe 报告 Kimi 额度耗尽；15:54 原因已查明（claude-10 自身的派工，d5e3147e）；" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01} {:id "象/言即行" :path "futon3/library/象/言即行.flexiarg" :hits 1 :line 1 :sha256 "3fa0edb7db29fcc22827ea8dcbc89f6319655b295b91319f46ae70c34d377469" :kind :practice :stage :believe :stage-mode :functional :node nil :confidence :high :rationale "The pattern requires every transfer to record its speech-act type and force explicitly on the envelope, so it represents and records what each message is." :quote-field "THEN" :quote "把类型放在信封上，把级联放在正文里：`(bell :type request :force 强 :cascade (...))`。" :flags [] :label-source :additions-2026-10-01}] :extraction-repair "futon1b 5d9938c; strictly descending whole-window keyset pages verified; cutoff unchanged"}